     *   <li>{@code actions.entityBlockChangeCoalesceWindowMs == 0} → 500ms (added 1.1.4)</li>
     *   <li>{@code actions.entityBlockChangeMaxTracked == 0} → 8192 (added 1.1.4)</li>
